INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (147,1,'2025-02-16 02:34:42','2025-02-16 02:34:42','<h1>Find Events In The Salem Area</h1>\n<p>Seamlessly browse for Salem\'s diverse events in the area</p>\n<p>					<a href=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/registration/\"><br />\n									Sign Up Today!<br />\n					</a><br />\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/havingfun.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/havingfun.webp 1024w, https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/havingfun-300x300.webp 300w, https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/havingfun-150x150.webp 150w, https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/havingfun-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><br />\n															<img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg 683w, https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1-300x264.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" /><br />\n															<img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg 683w, https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1-300x264.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" /><br />\n															<img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg 683w, https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1-300x264.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" /><br />\n															<img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1.jpeg 683w, https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about-1-300x264.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px\" />															</p>\n<h3>About Us</h3>\n<p>Use this section to describe your company and the services you offer. You could share your company’s story and details about why you are in business. The goal is to create a connection with the visitor and give them confidence to work with you.</p>\n<p>					<a href=\"#\"><br />\n									Learn more<br />\n					</a></p>\n<h3>Our Services</h3>\n<p>This text briefly introduces visitors to your main services.</p>\n<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"#\">Service 1</a></h4>\n<p>A short description of the service and how the visitor will benefit from it.</p>\n<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"#\">Service 2</a></h4>\n<p>A short description of the service and how the visitor will benefit from it.</p>\n<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"#\">Service 3</a></h4>\n<p>A short description of the service and how the visitor will benefit from it.</p>\n<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"#\">Service 4</a></h4>\n<p>A short description of the service and how the visitor will benefit from it.</p>\n<h3>Why Choose Us</h3>\n<h4>\n							benefit 1<br />\n					</h4>\n<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n<h4>\n							benefit 2<br />\n					</h4>\n<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n<h4>\n							benefit 3<br />\n					</h4>\n<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n<h4>\n							benefit 4<br />\n					</h4>\n<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n<h3>Client Testimonials</h3>\n<p>							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”<br />\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /><br />\n														Client Name<br />\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”<br />\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /><br />\n														Client Name<br />\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”<br />\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /><br />\n														Client Name</p>\n<h3>A Title to Turn the Visitor Into a Lead</h3>\n<p>		Use this short paragraph to explain how you will deliver this benefit to the visitor if they decide to work with you.<br />\n					<a href=\"#\"><br />\n									Learn more<br />\n					</a><br />\n															<img src=\"https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n										123-456-7890\n									</li>\n<li>\n										123 Main Street, New York, NY 10001\n									</li>\n<li>\n										Mon-Fri 9:00AM - 5:00PM\n									</li>\n</ul>\n<p>					<a target=\"_blank\"><br />\n						Facebook-f<br />\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>					</a><br />\n					<a target=\"_blank\"><br />\n											</a><br />\n					<a target=\"_blank\"><br />\n						Twitter<br />\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M459.37 151.716c.325 4.548.325 9.097.325 13.645 0 138.72-105.583 298.558-298.558 298.558-59.452 0-114.68-17.219-161.137-47.106 8.447.974 16.568 1.299 25.34 1.299 49.055 0 94.213-16.568 130.274-44.832-46.132-.975-84.792-31.188-98.112-72.772 6.498.974 12.995 1.624 19.818 1.624 9.421 0 18.843-1.3 27.614-3.573-48.081-9.747-84.143-51.98-84.143-102.985v-1.299c1