der to quickly find events that interest you!</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">List Your Events</a></h4><p>List your event with us for FREE!</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Google Calendar & Google Maps Integration</a></h4><p>Keep track of events and find your way there effortlessly.\n</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"683\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image_Placeholder-about.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Event Alerts</a></h4><p>Receive alerts about upcoming events!</p>				\n			<iframe loading=\"lazy\"\n					src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=%20Where%20O%27Keefe%20Complex%2C%20O%27Keefe%20Campus%20225%20Canal%20Street%2C%20Salem%2C%20MA%2001970%20Multipurpose%20Gym&#038;t=m&#038;z=10&#038;output=embed&#038;iwloc=near\"\n					title=\" Where O&#039;Keefe Complex, O&#039;Keefe Campus 225 Canal Street, Salem, MA 01970 Multipurpose Gym\"\n					aria-label=\" Where O&#039;Keefe Complex, O&#039;Keefe Campus 225 Canal Street, Salem, MA 01970 Multipurpose Gym\"\n			></iframe>\n					<h3>Why Choose Us</h3>				\n									<h4>\n							benefit 1						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 2						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 3						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 4						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n					<h3>Client Testimonials</h3>				\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n					<h3>A Title to Turn the Visitor Into a Lead</h3>				\n		Use this short paragraph to explain how you will deliver this benefit to the visitor if they decide to work with you.		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n															<img src=\"https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n										123-456-7890\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										123 Main Street, New York, NY 10001\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Mon-Fri 9:00AM - 5:00PM\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Facebook-f\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320