a! Whether you\'re a student, faculty member, or local community member, our mission is to keep you informed and engaged with the vibrant campus life and surrounding events.</strong></p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n					<h3>What We Offer</h3>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/discover-homepage-pic.webp\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Effortless Event Discovery</a></h4><p>Use our event finder to quickly find events that interest you!</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/list-events-homepage-pic.webp\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">List Your Events</a></h4><p>List your event with us for FREE!</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1078\" height=\"1077\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/magicut_1740116341890.webp\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Google Calendar & Google Maps Integration</a></h4><p>Keep track of events and find your way there effortlessly.\n</p>				\n					<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alerts-homepage-pic.webp\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure><h4><a href=\"#\">Event Alerts</a></h4><p>Receive alerts about upcoming events!</p>				\n			<iframe loading=\"lazy\"\n					src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=%20Where%20O%27Keefe%20Complex%2C%20O%27Keefe%20Campus%20225%20Canal%20Street%2C%20Salem%2C%20MA%2001970%20Multipurpose%20Gym&#038;t=m&#038;z=10&#038;output=embed&#038;iwloc=near\"\n					title=\" Where O&#039;Keefe Complex, O&#039;Keefe Campus 225 Canal Street, Salem, MA 01970 Multipurpose Gym\"\n					aria-label=\" Where O&#039;Keefe Complex, O&#039;Keefe Campus 225 Canal Street, Salem, MA 01970 Multipurpose Gym\"\n			></iframe>\n					<style>\n    /* Container to keep the calendar centered and styled */\n    .calendar-container {\n        max-width: 850px;\n        margin: 20px auto; /* Adds space from the top */\n        background: white;\n        padding: 15px;\n        border-radius: 12px;\n        box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n    }\n    /* Hover effect for a slight lift */\n    .calendar-container:hover {\n        transform: scale(1.02);\n        box-shadow: 0px 6px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n    }\n    /* Title style */\n    .calendar-title {\n        font-size: 22px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #333;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n    /* Calendar iframe styling */\n    .calendar-frame {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 600px;\n        border: none;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    /* Prevent layout shift or extra spacing issues */\n    .wp-block-group, .wp-block-column {\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    /* Responsive Fixes */\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n        .calendar-container {\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n        .calendar-frame {\n            height: 500px;\n        }\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 480px) {\n        .calendar-frame {\n            height: 450px;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n<!-- Calendar Embed -->\n    📅 Upcoming Events\n    <iframe src=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=024644856d6ce196b325d729d1a86f3b46e47080de04e38ddc0fe5ecb018f050%40group.calendar.google.com&ctz=America%2FNew_York\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe>\n					<h3>Why Choose Us</h3>				\n									<h4>\n							benefit 1						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 2						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 3						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n									<h4>\n							benefit 4						\n					</h4>\n									<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n					<h3>Client Testimonials</h3>				\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Client Name\n					<h3>Get Involved!\n</h3>				\n		<p>We believe that a connected community is a thriving community. Whether you\'re looking for a club meeting, a sports game, a music festival, or a guest lecture, Salem Events Hub is here to help you discover, connect, and participate, and make the most of your Salem State experience with Salem Events Hub: Discover Local Happenings!</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									📍 Start Exploring Today!\n					</a>\n															<img src=\"https://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n										123-456-7890\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										123 Main Street, New York, NY 10001\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Mon-Fri 9:00AM - 5:00PM\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Facebook-f\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M279.14 288l14.22-92.66h-88.91v-60.13c0-25.35 12.42-50.06 52.24-50.06h40.42V6.26S260.43 0 225.36 0c-73.22 0-121.08 44.38-121.08 124.72v70.62H22.89V288h81.39v224h100.17V288z\"></path></svg>					</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n											</a>\n					<a target=\"_blank\">\n						Twitter\n						<svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M459.37 151.716c.325 4.548.325 9.097.325 13.645 0 138.72-105.583 298.558-298.558 298.558-59.452 0-114.68-17.219-161.137-47.106 8.447.974 16.568 1.299 25.34 1.299 49.055 0 94.213-16.568 130.274-44.832-46.132-.975-84.792-31.188-98.112-72.772 6.498.974 12.995 1.624 19.818 1.624 9.421 0 18.843-1.3 27.614-3.573-48.081-9.747-84.143-51.98-84.143-102.985v-1.299c13.969 7.797 30.214 12.67 47.431 13.319-28.264-18.843-46.781-51.005-46.781-87.391 0-19.492 5.197-37.36 14.294-52.954 51.655 63.675 129.3 105.258 216.365 109.807-1.624-7.797-2.599-15.918-2.599-24.04 0-57.828 46.782-104.934 104.934-104.934 30.213 0 57.502 12.67 76.67 33.137 23.715-4.548 46.456-13.32 66.599-25.34-7.798 24.366-24.366 44.833-46.132 57.827 21.117-2.273 41.584-8.122 60.426-16.243-14.292 20.791-32.161 39.308-52.628 54.253z\"></path></svg>					</a>','Salem Events Hub: Discover Local Happenings','','inherit','closed','closed','','93-revision-v1','','','2025-02-21 16:46:04','2025-02-21 16:46:04','',93,'http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/?p=313',0,'revision','',0);
