ur go-to platform for exploring events and activities in the Salem area! Whether you\'re a student, faculty member, or local community member, our mission is to keep you informed and engaged with the vibrant campus life and surrounding events.</strong></p>\n<p>					<a href=\"#\"><br />\n									Learn more<br />\n					</a>\n<h3>What We Offer</h3>\n<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/discover-homepage-pic.webp\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"#\">Find Events</a></h4>\n<p>Use our event finder to quickly find events that interest you!</p>\n<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/list-events-homepage-pic.webp\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"#\">List Your Events</a></h4>\n<p>List your event with us for FREE!</p>\n<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1078\" height=\"1077\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/magicut_1740116341890.webp\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"#\">Google Calendar & Google Maps Integration</a></h4>\n<p>Keep track of events and find your way there effortlessly.\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/alerts-homepage-pic.webp\" alt=\"\" /></a></figure>\n<h4><a href=\"#\">Event Alerts</a></h4>\n<p>Receive alerts about upcoming events!</p>\n<p>			<iframe loading=\"lazy\"\n					src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=%20Where%20O%27Keefe%20Complex%2C%20O%27Keefe%20Campus%20225%20Canal%20Street%2C%20Salem%2C%20MA%2001970%20Multipurpose%20Gym&#038;t=m&#038;z=10&#038;output=embed&#038;iwloc=near\"\n					title=\" Where O&#039;Keefe Complex, O&#039;Keefe Campus 225 Canal Street, Salem, MA 01970 Multipurpose Gym\"\n					aria-label=\" Where O&#039;Keefe Complex, O&#039;Keefe Campus 225 Canal Street, Salem, MA 01970 Multipurpose Gym\"\n			></iframe></p>\n<style>\n    /* Container to keep the calendar centered and styled */<br />\n    .calendar-container {<br />\n        max-width: 850px;<br />\n        margin: 20px auto; /* Adds space from the top */<br />\n        background: white;<br />\n        padding: 15px;<br />\n        border-radius: 12px;<br />\n        box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);<br />\n        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;<br />\n    }<br />\n    /* Hover effect for a slight lift */<br />\n    .calendar-container:hover {<br />\n        transform: scale(1.02);<br />\n        box-shadow: 0px 6px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);<br />\n    }<br />\n    /* Title style */<br />\n    .calendar-title {<br />\n        font-size: 22px;<br />\n        font-weight: bold;<br />\n        color: #333;<br />\n        text-align: center;<br />\n        margin-bottom: 10px;<br />\n    }<br />\n    /* Calendar iframe styling */<br />\n    .calendar-frame {<br />\n        width: 100%;<br />\n        height: 600px;<br />\n        border: none;<br />\n        border-radius: 10px;<br />\n        overflow: hidden;<br />\n    }<br />\n    /* Prevent layout shift or extra spacing issues */<br />\n    .wp-block-group, .wp-block-column {<br />\n        overflow: hidden;<br />\n    }<br />\n    /* Responsive Fixes */<br />\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {<br />\n        .calendar-container {<br />\n            padding: 10px;<br />\n        }<br />\n        .calendar-frame {<br />\n            height: 500px;<br />\n        }<br />\n    }<br />\n    @media (max-width: 480px) {<br />\n        .calendar-frame {<br />\n            height: 450px;<br />\n        }<br />\n    }<br />\n</style>\n<p><!-- Calendar Embed --><br />\n    📅 Upcoming Events<br />\n    <iframe src=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=024644856d6ce196b325d729d1a86f3b46e47080de04e38ddc0fe5ecb018f050%40group.calendar.google.com&ctz=America%2FNew_York\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe></p>\n<h3>Why Choose Us</h3>\n<h4>\n							benefit 1<br />\n					</h4>\n<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n<h4>\n							benefit 2<br />\n					</h4>\n<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n<h4>\n							benefit 3<br />\n					</h4>\n<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n<h4>\n							benefit 4<br />\n					</h4>\n<p>\n						A short description of the benefit.					</p>\n<h3>Client Testimonials</h3>\n<p>							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”<br />\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /><br />\n														Client Name<br />\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”<br />\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /><br />\n														Client Name<br />\n							“A testimonial from a client who benefited from your product or service. Testimonials can be a highly effective way of establishing credibility and increasing your company\'s reputation.”<br />\n							<img width=\"63\" height=\"63\" src=\"http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Image-Testemonials.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /><br />\n														Client Name</p>\n<h3>\n					Get Involved!<br />\n				</h3>\n<p>We believe that a connected community is a thriving community. Whether you\'re looking for a club meeting, a sports game, a music festival, or a guest lecture, Salem Events Hub is here to help you discover, connect, and participate, and make the most of your Salem State experience with Salem Events Hub: Discover Local Happenings!</p>\n<p>					<a href=\"#\"><br />\n									📍 Start Exploring Today!<br />\n					</a></p>','Salem Events Hub: Discover Local Happenings','','inherit','closed','closed','','93-revision-v1','','','2025-02-23 02:52:00','2025-02-23 02:52:00','',93,'http://salem-events-hub-discover-local-happenings.local/?p=360',0,'revision','',0);
